PHASE 2 -- rl, photons=15, 29 specs, alpha=0.1, 5 seeds

1. Does the conclusion depend on the error metric?

   shift axis                    coverage (1-SSIM)    coverage (rel l2)   n
   none (in-distribution)           0.895+/-0.014        0.866+/-0.004    1015
   operator shift (Zernike)         0.757+/-0.022        0.581+/-0.043    280
   operator shift (physical)        0.898+/-0.018        0.849+/-0.019    420
   content shift                    0.479+/-0.022        0.000+/-0.000    1566
   combined                         0.015+/-0.005        0.000+/-0.000    432

   largest coverage difference between metrics: 0.479
   The two metrics are different functions of the reconstruction, so
   exact agreement is not expected. What matters is whether the
   ordering and the qualitative failure survive the swap.

   Spearman rho(1-SSIM, rel l2) on the test split: +0.880

