   family        kind      rung       |mismatch|    error  cov(SSIM)  cov(l2)   n
   defocus       zernike   extreme        0.9773   0.6823      0.571    0.486   35
   astigmatism   zernike   extreme        0.8915   0.6224      0.514    0.514   35
   coma          zernike   extreme        0.9674   0.6753      0.486    0.286   35
